<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-DALLAGLIO OUT OF ENGLAND SIDE WITH COLD.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-DALLAGLIO OUT OF ENGLAND SIDE WITH COLD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>England  flanker Lawrence Dallaglio pulled out of the side to meet Wales in the Five Nation's championship on Saturday, because of a bad cold.</p>
<p>His place in Cardiff will be taken by Ben Clarke, with Chris Sheasby taking over on the replacements' bench.</p>
</text>
